    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Change The Way We Innovate is a podcast that focuses on the changing dynamics of Silicon Valley. It aims to provide a general audience with an idea of the types of innovations and less-than-innovative companies that are being founded today. Using the framework of \"positive innovation,\" it explains to users the reasons why certain companies are not benefiting society, and provides examples of companies that do and do not represent positive innovation.",
